// ==========================================================================
//  Turtle Body -- shared helper modules and functions
// --------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  Small pieces that were copy-pasted across the standalone files. Geometry
//  lives in the per-subsystem lib/ modules; this file is only glue.
//
